{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ(ϋ)/＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰でしょうクイズ！！\n集計結果！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1位＊ろってぃ\n2位＊ひめたん\n3位＊せっちゃん\n4位＊みさみさ\n5位＊あみ\n6位＊あすか\n7位＊若様\n7位＊れいか\n7位＊さゆりん\n7位＊まりか\n7位＊せいたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とゆー結果になりましたヽ(^ω^)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃとひめたんが断トツ多かった！\nちゃんと数も数えたんで！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正解はっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"齋藤飛鳥！！\nでーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/03/05/5352532/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顎に載せた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥かわいい！\n顔ちっちゃい！\n細い！骨皮筋子！\nダンスうまい！\n軽い！骨皮筋子！\nブログおもしろい！\nコメントしたくなる！\nだからしちゃった！\n陰の努力家！\n飛鳥さいこー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふう꒰´•௰• `꒱\nこれくらいでいい？飛鳥ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥がいつもよりいっぱい褒めてみてって言うから褒めてみたよ꒰´•௰• `꒱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうさっっっ꒰´•௰• `꒱！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふ(´^ω^｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもまさか飛鳥とは思わなかったでしょー( ＾ω＾ )ね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分でも難しいと思ってた難問！\n正解した方！おめっと！さんでごわす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか楽しいので\nこれはどうだっっ！！！第二弾。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/03/05/5352532/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まえより広範囲だぞっ！\nちょっと怖いけどっ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"para